9fc7e6721.600x338.jpg?t=1756717432"}],"short_description":"A pure gameplay game, a variety of classic gameplay plus extended game configurations, you can draw custom graphics and apply them to other gameplay in the game, it is a highly expansive game.","steam_appid":3850220,"support_info":{"email":"1061588592@qq.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}